  "description": "These svg cut files have been created with crafters in mind. The SVG and DXF files can be imported to a number of paper craft programs, such as Silhouette Cameo and Cricut. Use the elements to make your very own creations. It is important that the svg cut files are accessible to all users and we understand that all craft cutting machines require different formats. Therefore each design comes with a wide range of files. \nFiles Included:\n– PNG\n– SVG\n– EPS\n– DXF\nThis file has been tested using a silhouette cameo, however it works on the majority of craft cutting machines. Please check compatibility before purchase.",
